{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Pause New Carbon Capture and Storage Projects Until Safety Is Proven",
        "additional_details": "Before approving further CCUS projects or funding, the Government must require all Track 1 & 2 projects to complete 24 consecutive months of commercial operation from their verified start dates, with independently audited safety & environmental performance, and compliance with approved budgets & construction schedules. Project Skylark must publish its CO\u2082 pipeline safety findings, with risks independently assessed. Public safety, environmental protection and taxpayers\u2019 money must take priority.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to pause approval of new CCUS projects until Track 1 and 2 projects have operated safely for two years, demonstrated compliance with construction budgets and timescales, and Project Skylark has published its findings on CO\u2082 pipeline safety risks.",
